infographic sequence-ascending-steps
data
  title The acks durability ladder
  desc Each rung trades speed for a stronger guarantee against data loss
  order asc
  sequences
    - label acks=0 — fire-and-forget
      desc Fastest; producer never waits. A crash loses the message — no durability.
    - label acks=1 — leader-only ack
      desc Leader confirms before replicating. Loses data if the leader dies first.
    - label acks=all — full ISR ack
      desc Every in-sync replica must have it. Survives leader failure with no loss.
theme
  palette #f43f5e #f59e0b #10b981
